          <description>SOURCE[ROM_REV0_PHY_PBUS]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact-packed-windows]. Selector 5 reads window 0, selector 0 non-path-1 reads window 1, and selector 0 path 1 or selector 4 non-path-1 reads window 2.</description>
